  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - Mpika Wind Power Project, through DNV GL Energy USA, Inc, f/k/a DNV KEMA Renewables, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A USTDA grant to Gobeleq Zambia Wind Limited funds a feasibility study for a proposed 100 megawatt (MW) wind power project near Mpika, Zambia. The study provides the project with the technical analysis needed to support the project in advancing towards financial close. This project is anticipated to be among Zambia&apos;s first utility-scale wind power plants, and will assist in diversifying the country&apos;s energy supply.</narrative>
  </description>
